 ☕️ Good morning! Time to caffeinate — we have Nvidia earnings after the close today, and all ears will be listening for how the new leadership handles questions on turmoil at the chip giant. Matt has more on that below.

 📿 Tech stocks are down early after the Trump administration moved to close a loophole that allowed Chinese companies to access sensitive U.S. technology through data centers outside the mainland.

 💰 Axios BFD, our annual dealmakers summit, returns to Manhattan today at 2pm ET. The lineup includes Donald Trump Jr., Kalshi CEO Tarek Mansour, Alex Rodriguez and more. Watch it live . 

